+# Tree-sitter grammars
+
+The MVP's symbol graph (`crates/muninn-symbols`, Phase 5) parses source with
+tree-sitter. Per `README.md`, the languages covered are: Rust, TypeScript/TSX,
+JavaScript/JSX, Python, and Go.
+
+| Language | Crate | Extensions |
+|---|---|---|
+| Rust | `tree-sitter-rust` | `.rs` |
+| TypeScript/TSX | `tree-sitter-typescript` | `.ts`, `.tsx` |
+| JavaScript/JSX | `tree-sitter-javascript` | `.js`, `.jsx` |
+| Python | `tree-sitter-python` | `.py` |
+| Go | `tree-sitter-go` | `.go` |
+
+Crate names follow the standard `tree-sitter-*` naming convention on
+crates.io; as of this writing `crates/muninn-symbols/Cargo.toml` is still a
+Phase 5 skeleton and has not yet pinned these dependencies.
